m, the maximum flow problem, the minimum cost flow problem, and the multi-commodity flow problem. We will also consider other extensions of network flow problems.", "course_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/15-082j-network-optimization-fall-2010/", "image_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/15-082j-network-optimization-fall-2010/46e0640fbe139dc81923049424ef58a5_15-082jf10.jpg", "license_name": "CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/", "resources": {"syllabus": true, "calendar": true, "readings": false, "lecture_notes": true, "assignments": true, "projects": true, "exams": true, "videos": false, "instructor_insights": false, "related_resources": false}, "metadata_origin": {"subject_primary": "source", "subject_secondary": "source", "academic_levels": "source", "course_feature_tags": "source"}, "capture_date": "2026-10-03", "last_verified_date": "2026-10-03", "extraction_status": "complete"}, "resources": [{"resource_id": "mitocw-15-082j-fall-2010-course-home", "course_id": "mitocw-15-082j-fall-2010", "resource_type": "course_home", "source_title": "Course Description", "source_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/15-082j-network-optimization-fall-2010/", "source_format": "html", "availability": "available", "extraction_policy": "full_text", "extraction_status": "complete", "local_path": "course-description.md", "capture_date": "2026-10-03", "content_sha256": "7ca7a5e4e24dc03b66dd0823404d9534992fabfb5a5745446fd4a0db8945e4ba", "error": null}, {"resource_id": "mitocw-15-082j-fall-2010-syllabus", "course_id": "mitocw-15-082j-fall-2010", "resource_type": "syllabus", "source_title": "Syllabus", "source_url": "https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/15-082j-network-optimization-fall-2010/pages/syllabus/", "source_format": "html", "availability": "available", "extraction_policy": "full_text", "extraction_status": "complete", "local_path": "syllabus.md", "capture_date": "2026-10-03", "content_sha256": "05e4bf74288b4ba60d3e22fcaad61279c65732e415